  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[C#m]I\nroamed\n[A]beyond laws of ti-\n[B]me\n[C#m]Severed from\n[A]beacons of light\n[B]\n[C#m]The agony\n[A]of the unknown\n[B]\n[C#m]Navigate\n[A]throught the\n[B]smoke\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C#m]A sister\n[A]lays with a\n[B]brave heart\n[C#m]Ground vibrates,\n[A]birds flee and\n[B]soar\n[D]\n[C#m]Sweet lady\n[A]fly you are\n[B]free\n[C#m]Bound by blood\n[A]always be with\n[B]me\n[D]\n\n[Break 1]\n[A]\n[F#m]\n[D]\n[E]\n\n[Bridge 1]\n[A]\n[F#m]\n[D]\n[E]\n[A]\n[F#m]\n[D]\n[E]\n[A]\n[F#m]\n[D]\n[E]\n\n[Bridge 2]\n[C#m]I'll\n[A]wait\n[B]for\nspring,\n[C#m]her\n[A]throne\n[B]will\nshine a-\n\n[Break 2]\n[C#m]gain\n\n[Outro 1]\n[C#m]Trees sit stripped\nof leaves\nThe morning freeze\neats me\nRowed my boat\nout to sea\nHer memory\nis in me\nFading land\ndraped in white\nEndless waves\ncaught my eye\nDrifting beneath the for-\nsaken sky [E]\n[C#m]Helpless and lost to\nhands [E]of\n\n[Outro 2]\n[D]time",
